2	//!
3	//! All items are stored as `kSecClassGenericPassword` under
4	//! service `"ezpds-identity-wallet"`. Use the `SERVICE` constant
5	//! to ensure consistency.
6	//!
7	//! In test builds (`#[cfg(test)]`), all Keychain operations are redirected to an
8	//! in-memory store so that tests never touch the real macOS Keychain and never
9	//! trigger a password prompt.
